      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5cfb491476b5b77800e860ec|full_name} From my understanding, you can use VRC credits to purchase roles, and I don't believe there is anything stopping someone from including the \"bypass\" permission as part of that role.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
