  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2026-04-11T02:45:15.384Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "With the new \"Avatar Performance Gated Group Instances\" feature and the included \"Bypass\" functionality for group roles with the permission, this feature request is asking for a limitation on groups selling access to use that feature as a \"perk\" or otherwise benefit in exchange for money.\n\nThere is a concern from the community that this bypass feature will be used as a purchasable perk for groups to generate revenue.\n\nAt the very least, it should be enforced that groups cannot sell a supporter role for VRChat credits that includes this permission. It must at least be assigned.\n\nBeyond that, if possible, this permission should not be able to be automatically assigned by external API access (such as synchronizing roles with Patreon, Discord, etc.). This permission should only be assignable manually and roles with this permission only be assigned manually.",
